{
  "name": "Lead Capture — Zero Spillage",
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-40, -60],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 460,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## Setup checklist\n1. Replace YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID in all 6 Google Sheets nodes (or reselect via From List). Sheet tab must be named 'Leads' with header row: lead_id, timestamp, name, email, raw_answers, status, score, score_reason, summary, draft_reply, final_reply, sent_at, last_error\n2. Replace COACH_EMAIL@example.com (2 Gmail approval nodes) and YOUR_ALERT_EMAIL@example.com (2 alert nodes)\n3. In 'AI System Prompt' node: replace COACH_NAME, COACH_FIRST_NAME, BOOKING_LINK, WHAT_THE_COACH_TEACHES\n4. Attach credentials: Google Sheets OAuth2, Gmail OAuth2, Anthropic API\n5. Self-hosted: set WEBHOOK_URL env var so approval-form links in emails are reachable\n6. Point your website form's POST at the production webhook URL"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-webhook",
      "name": "Lead Form Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 300],
      "webhookId": "7f3c2a1e-9b4d-4e6f-8a2c-5d1e0f9b7a3c",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "new-lead",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node-normalize",
      "name": "Normalize Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [200, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "lead_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $execution.id }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
